        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Colin Thiele\n- Places: Thiele Highway, Bower, South Australia, Eudunda, Morgan\n- Topics: naming origins, biography\n\nFacts:\n- Colin Thiele was born on 16 November 1920 and died on 4 September 2006.\n- Colin Thiele was an Australian author and educator.\n- Thiele Highway is named after author Colin Thiele.\n- Colin Thiele lived most of his life in towns along the route of Thiele Highway and set some of his stories in that area.\n- Bower is a town in South Australia.\n- Bower is located approximately halfway between Eudunda and Morgan on the Thiele Highway.",
